SWEET Trusty version probe (patch 0372, plan 2026-11-14 oneshot-2 step A3), boot-arg sweettrusty=1. Issues only the two version
fastcalls of the stock Trusty driver's probe (kernel/google-modules/trusty 2494a3e, drivers/trusty/trusty.c:725-750, 773-791, 1109-1111):
SMC_FC_GET_VERSION_STR 0xBC00000A (length, then one character per call) and SMC_FC_API_VERSION 0xBC00000B with 5. No std-call, no shared
memory, no MMIO. The logic and its allowlist are in the pure header bsd/dev/sweet_trusty.h (host test shim/trusty_host_test.c).
Lines: "SWEET TRUSTY: api=N version='...'" or "SWEET TRUSTY: stop <reason> ...", last "SWEET TRUSTY: probe done smc=N".
Without the boot-arg nothing changes.

